Algorithm 1: Training Procedure   
Input: Source Monolingual Data DS, Source Monolingual Data DT, Source Parse Tree TDS, Target Parse Tree TDT; Model Parameters $\theta$ ; Training Epochs N;  
for $t = 1,2,\dots ,N$ do  
Back-translation Step  
BS← Sample(DS);  
BT← MTs2T(BS);  
LT2S← Likelihood(MT2S( $\hat{B}_T$ ), BS); $\theta$ update LT2S;  
BT← Sample(DT); $\hat{B}_S$ ← MT2S(BT);  
LS2T← Likelihood(MTS2T( $\hat{B}_S$ ), BT); $\theta$ update LS2T;  
CONSTMLM/CONSTBTLM Step  
BS, TrS← Sample(TDS);  
BS^M, BS^L← Mask(BS, TrS);  
if CONSTBTLM then $\hat{B}_T$ ← MTs2T(BS);  
LS← Likelihood(MLM([BT ⊙ BS]), BS) + Likelihood LabelPred([BT ⊙ BS]), BS^L);  
else $\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{S}}$ ← Likelihood(MLM(BM), BS) + Likelihood LabelPred(BM), BS^L); $\theta$ update LS;  
BT, TrT← Sample(TDT); $\hat{B}_T$ ← MTs2T(BT);  
if CONSTBTLM then  
BT^M, BT^L← Mask(BT, TrT); $\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{T}}$ ← Likelihood(MLM([BT ⊙ BT^M]), BT) + Likelihood LabelPred([BT ⊙ BT^M]), BT^L);  
else $\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{T}}$ ← Likelihood(MLM(BM), BT) + Likelihood LabelPred(BM), BT^L); $\theta$ update LT;

